This constraint ensures that the transaction is signed by a PDA derived from the offramp program using a specific seed.Only the legitimate CCIP Offramp can produce this signature.### [Router Authorization](https://docs.chain.link/ccip/tutorials/svm/receivers#router-authorization)

The second critical validation is ensuring that the offramp is authorized by the CCIP Router:

