In this tutorial, you will use Chainlink CCIP to send data between smart contracts on different blockchains.First, you will pay for the CCIP fees on the source blockchain using LINK.Then, you will use the same contract to pay CCIP fees in native gas tokens.For example, you would use ETH on Ethereum or AVAX on Avalanche.## [Before you begin](https://docs.chain.link/ccip/tutorials/evm/send-arbitrary-data#before-you-begin)

